875792,"releaseDate":"2012-07-21T01:38:01Z","currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-10-18T16:38:38Z","genreIds":["6001","6012"],"minimumOsVersion":"18.6","primaryGenreName":"Weather","primaryGenreId":6001,"sellerName":"TINAC Inc.","isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true,"version":"6.6.0","wrapperType":"software","currency":"NOK","description":"Aurora Forecast answers one question: can you see the aurora tonight, from where you are? It brings together NOAA space weather, the sky above you, and reports from people nearby who are watching it right now.\n\n— SEE IT AS IT HAPPENS —\nWhen people near you spot the aurora, their reports appear on the map and on the Home tab, showing how many have seen it within 100 km and how close the nearest one is. Seeing it yourself? Share it in one tap. No account needed, and every location is blurred to about 1 km before anyone else sees it.\n\n— KNOW BEFORE THE SKY GLOWS —\n• NOAA OVATION 30-minute aurora forecast on a map and a 3D globe\n• Aurora probability for your exact location\n• Kp index history, 3-day forecast and 27-day outlook\n• Live solar wind: speed, density and magnetic field (Bz)\n• Cloud cover, moon phase, sunrise and sunset\n• Live aurora webcams and real-time images of the Sun\n• Aurora hotspots: well-known viewing spots, including dark-sky parks\n• Aurora Guide, plus Stories & News from the world of the aurora\n\n— AURORA INTELLIGENCE (ULTIMATE) —\nOne clear answer to \"Should I go out now?\", weighing the forecast, the clouds above you, the moonlight and reports from people nearby. On iPhones with Apple Intelligence it runs on your device; otherwise it uses our cloud AI.\n\n— ALERTS, WIDGETS AND APPLE WATCH —\n• Aurora alerts for your location (Pro)\n• Apple Watch complications (Pro)\n• Home Screen and Lock Screen widgets (Ultimate)\n• Detailed cloud cover by altitude (Ultimate)\n\n— ON EVERY SCREEN —\niPhone, iPad, and iPhone Duo open or folded, in 32 languages.\n\n— SUBSCRIPTIONS —\nThe forecast, maps, live data, webcams and community reports are free.\n• Aurora Pro, monthly or yearly: aurora alerts and Apple Watch complications\n• Aurora Ultimate Pro, monthly or yearly: everything in Pro, plus Aurora Intelligence, widgets and detailed cloud cover\nPrices are shown in the app in your local currency.\n\nPayment will be charged to your Apple Account at confirmation of purchase. Subscriptions renew automatically unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can manage or cancel your subscriptions in Settings > [your name] > Subscriptions.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.tinacinc.com/AuroraForecast/privacy_policy.html\nTerms of Use: https://www.tinacinc.com/AuroraForecast/terms_of_conditions.html","averageUserRating":4.43809,"trackCensoredName":"Aurora Forecast.","trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/no/app/aurora-forecast/id539875792?uo=4","contentAdvisoryRating":"4+","genres":["Weather","Lifestyle"],"trackName":"Aurora Forecast.","artistName":"TINAC Inc.","userRatingCount":1276}